"description":"HabitKit is a clean habit tracker, routine planner, and focus timer built to help you stay consistent without clutter. Create better routines, hit daily goals, review streaks, and protect deep work with app blocking on supported devices. Whether you are building a morning routine, tracking health goals, studying, working out, reading, or reducing distractions, HabitKit gives you a calm system for steady progress.\n\nTRACK HABITS YOUR WAY\n- Create daily, weekly, or monthly habits\n- Set custom targets and units like minutes, pages, glasses, reps, or sessions\n- Use custom icons, colors, descriptions, and notes\n- Organize habits into categories for work, health, home, study, or personal growth\n- Mark habits complete fast or adjust counts with quick increments\n- Edit past days and review every habit on a calendar\n\nSEE REAL PROGRESS\n- Track current streak, best streak, completion rate, and period totals\n- Review a consistency heatmap, leaderboard, and current goal progress\n- See active habits at a glance in cards, compact, or minimal dashboard views\n- Archive habits when a routine changes and restore them anytime\n\nDEEP FOCUS, BUILT IN\n- Start flexible Deep Focus sessions\n- Pause, resume, finish early, or save completed sessions to history\n- Link focus sessions to a habit and auto-log minutes or completions\n- Review today's focus time, weekly focus minutes, recent sessions, and focus streaks\n- Block distracting apps during focus on supported devices for stronger boundaries\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\n- Add habit reminders plus a daily check-in reminder\n- Choose themes, font size, date labels, week start, and dashboard layout\n- Use multiple app languages, including English, Spanish, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Brazilian Portuguese, and Simplified Chinese\n\nPRIVATE BY DEFAULT\n- No account required\n- No remote database or cloud sync running in the background\n- Your data stays on your device unless you export it\n- Export and import JSON backups whenever you choose\n\nIf you want a habit tracker, routine planner, streak tracker, focus timer, and distraction blocker in one simple app, HabitKit is built for you.", "bundleId":"com.devgenesis.habitkit", "trackCensoredName":"HabitKit: Focus Habit Tracker", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/habitkit-focus-habit-tracker/id6761298880?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":0, "userRatingCount":0}]
